WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.734
-Welcome back. We are
hanging out with Jane Fonda.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:09.400
Now, Jane and I are about to go
head-to-head

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.367
in a game of "Egg Roulette."

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.367
Higgins, would you like to
explain how this works?

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.934
-Yes, James.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:18.834
Here, in my hand,
I have one dozen eggs.

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.400
Eight of them
have been hard boiled.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.234
Four of them are still raw.

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:27.267
You and Jane will take turns
selecting one egg at a time

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.734
and smashing it upon the top
of your head.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.067
-Okay.
-You won't know which eggs

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:34.133
are raw and which are boiled
until you smash it.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.834
Once you choose an egg,
you must smash it.

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:38.367
No put-backs.

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:42.200
The first one to smash two
raw eggs on their head loses.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.701
-Loses.
-Ms. Fonda, would you like

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:45.467
to choose the first egg?

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:47.167
-Whoa, very confident.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.934 --> 00:00:51.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.501
[ Sad tuba ]

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:57.300
What in the world?

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.634
That was -- [ Laughs ]
That was the fastest --

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:03.167
That was --

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.634
Oh, let's go. Yeah.

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:14.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.767
Whoo -- No, no, no, no.

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:16.934
Here we go.
Now this is --

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:18.067
♪♪

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.133
-Slimy!

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:20.133
-Here we go.

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:21.133
That was the fastest
I've ever --

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:22.801
-Wow, yolk's on you.

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:25.000
-Yeah -- Wow. Wow, wow.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.067
-The yolk's on him.
-You are officially the coolest.

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:30.234
Here we go.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.734
Thank you so much for coming
on the show,

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:36.467
and congrats on your new movie
"Luck,"

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:37.734
which I have good luck.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:42.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:44.567
-Oh.
-Ow!

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:46.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:48.167
Ow.

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.734
-You just grab.
I take my time picking it out.

00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:51.767
Audience?

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:54.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:58.300
-Go for it.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.868
-I have a weird feeling
about this one.

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:02.033
-No excuses.
-Oh, I like that.

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:03.200
Here we go. Come on.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:04.968
[ Imitates drum roll ]

00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:05.968
Hai-ya!

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:07.100
Nice.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:13.133
[ Laughs ]

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.634
-Oh, maybe that was a sign.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:16.634
-Oh!

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:17.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:19.701
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:22.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.834
-Unbelievable!

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:26.000
[ Laughs ]

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:34.701
Wait, I have to -- I have to do
just one for fun,

00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:36.567
because I can't just let you
do this.

00:02:36.567 --> 00:02:38.400
I did not plan this out at all,
by the way.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.634
But, you know I'm -- look.

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:41.033
-What does that mean,
one for fun?

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:42.367
-One for fun.
-One, each of you.

00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:44.868
-Can you break one on my head?

00:02:44.868 --> 00:02:46.934
Please.
-I'm so glad you asked.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:47.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.834
-Two?
-Oh, two?

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:51.601
♪♪

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:54.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.601 --> 00:02:57.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.100
[ Sad tuba ]

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:02.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:04.200
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.367
-The one and only Jane Fonda,
everybody!

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:11.000
Her movie, "Luck," premieres
on AppleTV+ August 5th.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.734
More "Tonight Show"
after the break.

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:14.000
Stick around.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.968
Oh, my God.

